Z||000000||Sootah||11-16-2001||10:20 PM||||Are there any import engines that will go into a Fiero without much effort? I know the Cavalier over there is in Toyota's name and all, so perhaps this would be an option? The reason I ask is I may have a way to get low-mileage engines for really cheap, however they are all imports. (Has to do with Japan's emmissions laws or something, going to look into it)<P>Anyway, thanx.<P><B><I>-Sootah</B></I><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Nuclear_Happy_Face_Sig.jpg">       <BR><sup><A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Black_Beauty_-_Front_Right.jpg" TARGET=_blank>85 GT</A> - <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Sootah__Busted-Ass_SE.jpg" TARGET=_blank>86 SE</A> (Parts car)<BR><I>Never pull your pants down in Cosco, the dang monkeys will getcha</I></sup> <BR><sup><B>AIM</B>: KSSouter</sup>||||reg||2
