Z||000014||AJ88||11-20-2001||01:24 AM||||Yeah, Japan has a very interesting licensing system for auto's over there.  Basically the only affordable thing to do is buy a new car every 3 years (I think that's the number) because to have a car that is more than 3 years old on the road costs more than a new car.<P>Ie. insurance rates go like this:<P>$1000 first year<BR>$1000 second year<BR>$1000 third year<BR>$50000 fourth year.<P>So you might as well get rid of your car and get a new one.||||reg||1
